{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam al-Hasan and Imam al-Husayn (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL HASANI WAL HUSAYN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon al-Hasan and al-Husayn,\nعَبْدَيْكَ وَوَلِيَّيْكَ\nA'BDAYKA WA WALIYYAYK\nYour two servants and friends,\nوَابْنَيْ رَسُولِكَ وَسِبْطَيِ الرَّحْمَةِ\nWABNAY RASOOLIKA WA SIBTAYIR RAHMAH\nthe two sons of Your Messenger, the two grandsons of Mercy,\nوَسَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nWA SAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nand the two chiefs of the youth of Paradise,\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ اَحَدٍ مِنْ اَوْلَادِ النَّبِيِّينَ وَالْمُرْسَلِينَ\nAFDALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHADIN MIN AWLAADIN NABIYYEENA WAL MURSALEEN\nwith the most excellent blessings that You have ever sent upon any of the sons of the Prophets and the Messengers.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ الْحَسَنِ ابْنِ سَيِّدِ النَّبِيِّينَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL HASANIBNI SAYYIDIN NABIYYEEN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon al-Hasan the son of the chief of the Prophets\nوَوَصِيِّ اَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA WASIYYI AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nand the successor of the Commander of the Faithful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah's Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّينَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA SAYYIDIL WASIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the chief of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ يَا بْنَ اَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA YABNA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nI bear witness that you are verily the son of the Commander of the Faithful,\nاَمِينُ اللَّهِ وَابْنُ اَمِينِهٖ\nAMEENULLAAHI WABNU AMEENIH\nthe trustee of Allah, and the son of His trustee.\nعِشْتَ رَشِيداً مَظْلُوماً\nI'SHTA RASHEEDAN MAZLOOMAA\nYou lived upright and persecuted\nوَمَضَيْتَ شَهِيداً\nWA MADAYTA SHAHEEDAA\nand passed away as martyr.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الاِمَامُ الزَّكِيُّ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKAL IMAAMUZ ZAKIYY\nAnd I bear witness that you are verily the pure,\nالْهَادِي الْمَهْدِيُّ\nAL-HAADIL MAHDIYY\nguiding, and well-guided leader.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAYH\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon him\nوَبَلِّغْ رُوحَهٗ وَجَسَدَهٗ عَنِّي\nWA BALLIGH ROOHAHOO WA JASADAHOO A'NNEE\nand convey to his soul and body\nفِي هٰذِهِ السَّاعَةِ اَفْضَلَ التَّحِيَّةِ وَالسَّلَامِ\nFEE HAADHIHIS SAA'ATI AFDALAT TAHIYYATI WAS SALAAM\nat this hour the best greeting and salutation from me.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ الْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL HUSAYNIBNI A'LIYY\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon al-Husayn the son of 'Ali,\nالْمَظْلُومِ الشَّهِيدِ\nAL-MAZLOOMISH SHAHEED\nthe oppressed, the martyr,\nقَتِيلِ الْكَفَرَةِ وَطَرِيحِ الْفَجَرَةِ\nQATEELIL KAFARATI WA TAREEHIL FAJARAH\nthe slain by the unbelievers, and the thrown down by the sinful people.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ABAA A'BDILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-'Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah's Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ اَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Commander of the Faithful.\nاَشْهَدُ مُوقِناً اَنَّكَ اَمِينُ اللَّهِ وَابْنُ اَمِينِهٖ\nASH-HADU MOOQINAN ANNAKA AMEENULLAAHI WABNU AMEENIH\nI bear witness with full conviction that you are verily the trustee of Allah and the son of His trustee.\nقُتِلْتَ مَظْلُوماً وَمَضَيْتَ شَهِيداً\nQUTILTA MAZLOOMAN WA MADAYTA SHAHEEDAA\nYou were killed wrongly and you passed away as martyr.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ اللَّهَ تَعَالَىٰ الطَّالِبُ بِثَاْرِكَ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNALLAAHA TA'AALAT TAALIBU BITHA'RIK\nI also bear witness that Allah the All-exalted is the One Who shall avenge You\nوَمُنْجِزٌ مَا وَعَدَكَ مِنَ النَّصْرِ وَالتَّاْيِيدِ\nWA MUNJIZUN MAA WA-A'DAKA MINAN NASRI WAT TA'YEED\nand shall fulfill His promise to You of support and victory\nفِي هَلَاكِ عَدُوِّكَ وَاِظْهَارِ دَعْوَتِكَ\nFEE HALAAKI A'DUWWIKA WA IZHAARI DA'WATIK\nthrough exterminating your enemies and demonstrating your call (to the true guidance).\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ وَفَيْتَ بِعَهْدِ اللَّهِ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKA WAFAYTA BI-A'HDILLAAH\nI also bear witness that you fulfilled your covenant with Allah,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ\nWA JAAHADTA FEE SABEELILLAAH\nstrove hard for His sake,\nوَعَبَدْتَ اللَّهَ مُخْلِصاً حَتَّىٰ اَتَاكَ الْيَقِينُ\nWA A'BADTALLAAHA MUKHLISAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEEN\nand served Allah sincerely until death came upon you.\nلَعَنَ اللَّهُ اُمَّةً قَتَلَتْكَ\nLA-A'NALLAAHU UMMATAN QATALATK\nMay Allah curse the people who killed you.\nوَلَعَنَ اللَّهُ اُمَّةً خَذَلَتْكَ\nWA LA-A'NALLAAHU UMMATAN KHADHALATK\nMay Allah curse the people who disappointed you.\nوَلَعَنَ اللَّهُ اُمَّةً اَلَّبَتْ عَلَيْكَ\nWA LA-A'NALLAAHU UMMATAN ALLABAT A'LAYK\nMay Allah curse the people who incited people against you.\nوَاَبْرَاُ اِلَىٰ اللَّهِ تَعَالَىٰ مِمَّنْ اَكْذَبَكَ\nWA ABRA'U ILALLAAHI TA'AALAA MIMMAN AKDHABAK\nI release myself before Allah the All-exalted from those who belied you,\nوَاسْتَخَفَّ بِحَقِّكَ وَاسْتَحَلَّ دَمَكَ\nWASTAKHAFFA BIHAQQIKA WASTAHALLA DAMAK\nbelittled your right, and allowed themselves to shed your blood.\nبِاَبِي اَنْتَ وَاُمِّي يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ\nBI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA ABAA A'BDILLAAH\nMay my father and mother be ransoms for you.\nلَعَنَ اللَّهُ قَاتِلَكَ\nLA-A'NALLAAHU QAATILAK\nAllah's curse be on those who killed you.\nوَلَعَنَ اللَّهُ خَاذِلَكَ\nWA LA-A'NALLAAHU KHAADHILAK\nAllah's curse be on those who let you down.\nوَلَعَنَ اللَّهُ مَنْ سَمِعَ وَاعِيَتَكَ فَلَمْ يُجِبْكَ وَلَمْ يَنْصُرْكَ\nWA LA-A'NALLAAHU MAN SAMI'A WAA'IYATAKA FALAM YUJIBKA WA LAM YANSURK\nAllah's curse be on those who heard your call (for help), but they refrained from responding to you or supporting you.\nوَلَعَنَ اللَّهُ مَنْ سَبَىٰ نِسَاءَكَ\nWA LA-A'NALLAAHU MAN SABAA NISAA'AK\nAllah's curse be on those who captured your women.\nاَنَا اِلَىٰ اللَّهِ مِنْهُمْ بَرِيءٌ وَمِمَّنْ وَالَاهُمْ\nANAA ILALLAAHI MINHUM BAREE'UN WA MIMMAN WAALAAHUM\nI disavow them all before Allah and disavow those who adhered to them,\nوَمَالَاَهُمْ وَاَعَانَهُمْ عَلَيْهِ\nWA MAALA'AHUM WA A'AANAHUM A'LAYH\nthose who kept up with them, and those who helped them against you.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ وَالْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ وُلْدِكَ كَلِمَةُ التَّقْوَىٰ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKA WAL A'IMMATA MIN WULDIKA KALIMATUT TAQWAA\nI also bear witness that you and the Imams from your descendants are the word of piety,\nوَبَابُ الْهُدَىٰ وَالْعُرْوَةُ الْوُثْقَىٰ\nWA BAABUL HUDAA WAL U'RWATUL WUTHQAA\nthe door to true guidance, the firmest handle,\nوَالْحُجَّةُ عَلَىٰ اَهْلِ الدُّنْيَا\nWAL HUJJATU A'LAA AHLID DUNYAA\nand the argument against the inhabitants of this world.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنِّي بِكُمْ مُؤْمِنٌ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNEE BIKUM MU'MIN\nI also bear witness that I have full faith in you,\nوَبِمَنْزِلَتِكُمْ مُوقِنٌ\nWA BIMANZILATIKUM MOOQIN\nI have conviction in your standing,\nوَلَكُمْ تَابِعٌ بِذَاتِ نَفْسِي\nWA LAKUM TAABI'UN BIDHAATI NAFSEE\nand I always follow you in myself,\nوَشَرَائِعِ دِينِي وَخَوَاتِيمِ عَمَلِي\nWA SHARAA'I'I DEENEE WA KHAWAATEEMI A'MALEE\nin the laws of my religion, in my sealing deeds,\nوَمُنْقَلَبِي فِي دُنْيَايَ وَآخِرَتِي\nWA MUNQALABEE FEE DUNYAAYA WA AAKHIRATEE\nin my tour, and in my settlement in this worldly life and the Hereafter.",
  "merits": "Within the recommended rites on Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in his book of Misbah al-Mutahajjid, has mentioned the following invocation of blessings from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.)."
